  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In diffraction, first minima, we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0137_bccf15e6309f.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 185px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Then, minimum size of a spot, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8706;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8706;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>L</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>So,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>L</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>L</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>L</mi></msqrt></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>L</mi></msqrt></math>&nbsp;</p>"
